  "source_audit": "clear-default-source-audit.json",
  "observations": [
    "Each final pinned engine passes 236 checks/112 complete native images across existing plain/password/Unicode, URL/tel, email, search editing/clear, search submit and new clear-default contracts. The focused Chromium key-retirement cohort adds 4 checks/1 image.",
    "Each new clear-default cohort includes 30 checks/17 full native images. Actual click listeners see the original value; click cancellation, removal, disable/type changes, focus diversion, canonical replacement values and beforeinput cancellation/removal retain the intended native/application boundaries. Real key interruption produces exactly one trusted insertText pair and no later clear.",
    "Four browser compatibility cohorts add 64 checks/36 images: both engines with older adapters/new provider, and new adapters/older provider. Their original clear, beforeinput cancellation, read-only/disabled behavior and retirement checks remain passing. These fallback cohorts do not claim the new deferred-click feature.",
    "Seven native-provider probes pass. The original class/cell/size/part witness now checks deferred commit exactly once, the original cancel-button rectangle at the actual native method invocation, and unknown-command original-action fallback. Older providers lacking clear commands, search activation or all search support also pass their modes.",
    "Paired baseline failures show the original native clear runs before the DOM click: the listener sees an empty value and preventDefault cannot prevent the earlier trusted beforeinput/input. Those failures are retained and excluded from final totals.",
    "The first deferred candidates pass 26 checks/15 images, then keyboard cases expand this to 29/17. Source review replaces the convenience cell performClick: call with the original performClickWithFrame:inView: using the original cancel rectangle, avoiding full-control button highlighting. The final provider is independently witnessed and reruns the complete paired cohorts.",
    "A held-button plain typing check could also pass through the browser fallback. The stronger real Ctrl+A witness distinguishes native caret-beginning behavior from browser select-all. Firefox now ends native pointer tracking before its existing native key dispatch; no key table or algorithm is copied.",
    "The old key-retirement assertion expected delete because the premature native clear ran first. Its retained diagnostic instead records the actual real key: trusted insertText beforeinput with data x and no input after callback removal. The updated assertion requires that exact key event and native lifetime release.",
    "Both current adapter reproductions and the final shared native loader/provider reproductions are byte-identical to tested candidates. All 20 measured production files, earlier UI/adapters and 1050-package set remain unchanged. Owned renderer descendants retain Seccomp=2/NoNewPrivs=1; no owned candidate mappings remain after shutdown. No browser executable or underlying AppKit was rebuilt/deployed."
  ],
  "open": [
    "Search-clear search notifications, recents, placeholders, broader keyboard/undo/editing/style/intrinsic layout/zoom/scaling/IME/accessibility contracts. Click-default qualification is not whole-search completion.",
    "Other specialized webpage controls, other browser builds/derivatives, complete detached menus/native shortcuts and installed deployment; then GTK/Qt/KDE through the same shared library.",
    "Future requested browser toolbar/tab changes belong to optional application patches consuming the shared provider."
  ]
}
